  "name": "Brand studio",
  "description": "Your personal brand on social media: a strategist who learns your goals and voice and plans each week, a creator who drafts posts for every platform, and a community manager who publishes only what you approve and brings back replies and results. Every post, reply and message waits for your approval.",
